# ---- GraphRAG indexing results and caches (regenerable from prompts + settings + input) ----
**/output/
**/output_pre_redesign_backup/
**/cache/
**/logs/
**/lancedb/
**/*.parquet
**/index_run.log
*.log

# ---- LaTeX project (synced with Overleaf); the compiled manuscript PDFs are tracked instead ----
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/IEEEAccess9.22/

# ---- scripts written during the revision ----
*.py
*.ipynb
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/scoring/*.sh
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/graph_quality/run_all.sh

# ---- scoring caches (raw API responses; results are in per_answer_scores.csv) ----
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/scoring/judge_cache/
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/scoring/stage2_cache/
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/scoring/stage2_cache_zh_partial/
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/scoring/heldout_cache/
seisKG_graphragoutputs/paper/scoring/translate_cache/

# ---- third-party catalogs (Shelly 2020; Guan et al. 2024): not redistributed ----
seisKG_graphrag_ridgecrest*/input/
seisKG_graphrag_maduo*/input/

# ---- secrets, system and tool files ----
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
.claude/
~$*

# ---- editor backups inside workspaces; third-party paper PDFs ----
*.bak
*.bak2
